                                        "entry_id": "09529955-bc32-3442-8ff1-644a5ba00cdb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lexical aspect (aktionsart) of verbs or predicates that change over time until a natural end point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
